###Mapping
Mapping test::coralcove2::mapping::ReefMapping
(
  *test::coralcove2::domain::Cove[cove]: Relational
  {
    ~primaryKey
    (
      [test::coralcove2::store::ReefDB]reef.cove.cove_code
    )
    ~mainTable [test::coralcove2::store::ReefDB]reef.cove
    coveCode: [test::coralcove2::store::ReefDB]reef.cove.cove_code,
    coveName: [test::coralcove2::store::ReefDB]reef.cove.cove_name,
    shorelineCode: [test::coralcove2::store::ReefDB]reef.cove.shoreline_code
  }

  *test::coralcove2::domain::ReefSite[reefSite]: Relational
